[2026-07-01] GraphDiffusionPipeline: unified box+pose diffusion denoiser

New files:
- src/decoders/diffusion/graph_pipeline.py: GraphDiffusionPipelineDecoder +
  GraphDiffusionPipelineDecoderConfig. Two-stage denoiser: Stage 1 = attention
  trunk (instance slots × image tokens, joint path × instance latents; follows
  QueryProbe pattern); Stage 2 = GNN refiner (PoseGraphLayer stack, visual
  features bilinearly sampled from spatial_feat at Stage 1 joint predictions).
  Diffusion state = (boxes [B,N,4], joints_rel [B,N,K,2]) with EDM Heun sampling.
- src/training/graph_pipeline_module.py: GraphDiffusionPipelineModule (Lightning)
  + GraphDiffusionPipelineModuleConfig. Pads GT to N slots with random noise,
  shuffles, adds σ·ε, forwards through decoder, computes GraphPipelineLoss.
  Uses RadioFeatureExtractor (frozen backbone).

Modified files:
- src/training/losses.py: added GraphPipelineLossWeights, _graph_pipeline_matching_cost,
  and GraphPipelineLoss (Hungarian matching on combined box L1+GIoU+kpt L2 cost;
  box L1/GIoU/L2, keypoint L2, objectness BCE, and ranking losses).
- tests/test_graph_pipeline.py: 18 unit tests (decoder forward, EDM schedule,
  sample, config round-trip, loss). All pass.

